        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sql, core]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SQL Core - The 30-Year Refresh",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "> What you knew from ADO.NET/T-SQL circa 2000–2003 is still valid. The SELECT/JOIN/GROUP BY model is unchanged.\n> What changed is everything *above* that — CTEs, window functions, JSON, temporal tables, modern DML,\n> and two decades of syntax ergonomics. This file is those additions plus a complete reference card.\n> PostgreSQL syntax is used as the baseline (most ANSI-compliant); T-SQL divergences are called out inline."
    },
    {
      "id": "01-SQL-CORE.md#002",
      "path": [
        "01-SQL-CORE.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:01-sql-core, git-history:query-languages:01-sql-core]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/01-SQL-CORE.md",
        "concepts": "[sql, core]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/01-SQL-CORE.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sql-core",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sql, core]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SQL Core - The 30-Year Refresh",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                           SQL LANGUAGE SURFACE                                      │\n├──────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┬────────────────────────────┤\n│  DDL             │  DML             │  DCL             │  TCL                        │\n│  ─────────────── │  ─────────────── │  ─────────────── │  ───────────────            │\n│  CREATE TABLE    │  SELECT          │  GRANT           │  BEGIN                      │\n│  ALTER TABLE     │  INSERT          │  REVOKE          │  COMMIT                     │\n│  DROP TABLE      │  UPDATE          │  ─────────────── │  ROLLBACK                   │\n│  CREATE INDEX    │  DELETE          │  Row-Level Sec.  │  SAVEPOINT                  │\n│  CREATE VIEW     │  MERGE           │  Column priv.    │  SET ISOLATION LEVEL        │\n│  CREATE SEQUENCE │  TRUNCATE        │                  │                             │\n│  ─────────────── │  ─────────────── │                  │                             │\n│  Schema          │  Query Exprs:    │                  │                             │\n│  Constraints     │  ─────────────── │                  │                             │\n│  Types           │  FROM / JOIN     │                  │                             │\n│  Partitioning    │  WHERE / HAVING  │                  │                             │\n│                  │  GROUP BY        │                  │                             │\n│                  │  Window OVER()   │                  │                             │\n│                  │  CTEs (WITH)     │                  │                             │\n│                  │  Set ops         │                  │                             │\n│                  │  Subqueries      │                  │                             │\n└──────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┴────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
