        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "SQL Core - The 30-Year Refresh",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "─── SQL:1999 additions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nWITH cte AS (...)                            ← Common Table Expressions (huge)\nWITH RECURSIVE cte AS (...)                  ← Tree/graph traversal\nBOOLEAN type                                 ← true/false as first-class type"
    },
    {
