      "text": "─── SQL:2003 additions ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nfn() OVER (PARTITION BY ... ORDER BY ...)    ← Window functions (biggest feature gap)\nMERGE INTO target USING source ON ...        ← Upsert on steroids\nGENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY                 ← Standard identity columns"
    },
